ngth</var> is less than or equal to
 <var>string</var>=E2=80=99s <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infr=
a.spec.whatwg.org/#string-code-point-length" id=3D"ref-for-string-code-poin=
t-length=E2=91=A0">code point length</a>.</p>
    </li><li>
     <p>Let <var>result</var> be the empty string.</p>
    </li><li>
     <p><a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#li=
st-iterate" id=3D"ref-for-list-iterate=E2=91=A4">For each</a> <var>i</var> =
of <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#the-exc=
lusive-range" id=3D"ref-for-the-exclusive-range=E2=91=A0">the range</a> fro=
m
 <var>start</var> to <var>start</var> + <var>length</var>, exclusive: appen=
d the <var>i</var>th
 <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#code-poin=
t" id=3D"ref-for-code-point=E2=91=A2=E2=91=A3">code point</a> of <var>strin=
g</var> to <var>result</var>.</p>
    </li><li>
     <p>Return <var>result</var>.</p>
   </li></ol>
   <p>The <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-export=3D""=
 data-lt=3D"code point substring by positions" id=3D"code-point-substring-b=
y-positions">code point substring</dfn> from
<var>start</var> to <var>end</var> within a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=
=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#string" id=3D"ref-for-string=E2=91=A2=E2=
=91=A8">string</a> <var>string</var> is the
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#code-point=
-substring" id=3D"ref-for-code-point-substring">code point substring</a> wi=
thin <var>string</var> from <var>start</var> with length
