espace" id=3D"ref-for-ascii-whitespace=E2=91=A0">ASCII whitespace</a> that =
are at the start or the end of the <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https:=
//infra.spec.whatwg.org/#string" id=3D"ref-for-string=E2=91=A4=E2=91=A2">st=
ring</a>.

</p>
   <p>To <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-export=3D"" =
id=3D"strip-and-collapse-ascii-whitespace">strip and collapse ASCII whitesp=
ace</dfn> in a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.=
org/#string" id=3D"ref-for-string=E2=91=A4=E2=91=A3">string</a>, replace an=
y sequence
of one or more consecutive <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.=
spec.whatwg.org/#code-point" id=3D"ref-for-code-point=E2=91=A3=E2=91=A2">co=
de points</a> that are <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec=
.whatwg.org/#ascii-whitespace" id=3D"ref-for-ascii-whitespace=E2=91=A1">ASC=
II whitespace</a> in the <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.sp=
ec.whatwg.org/#string" id=3D"ref-for-string=E2=91=A4=E2=91=A4">string</a>
with a single U+0020 SPACE <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.=
spec.whatwg.org/#code-point" id=3D"ref-for-code-point=E2=91=A3=E2=91=A3">co=
