</p>
   <hr>
   <p>To <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-export=3D"" =
data-lt=3D"collect a sequence of code points|collecting a sequence of code
points" id=3D"collect-a-sequence-of-code-points">collect a sequence of <a d=
ata-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#code-point" id=
=3D"ref-for-code-point=E2=91=A3=E2=91=A4">code points</a></dfn> meeting a c=
ondition <var>condition</var> from
a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#string" =
id=3D"ref-for-string=E2=91=A4=E2=91=A5">string</a> <var>input</var>, given =
a <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"string" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" =
data-export=3D"" id=3D"string-position-variable">position variable</dfn>
<var>position</var> tracking the position of the calling algorithm within <=
var>input</var>:</p>
   <ol>
    <li>
     <p>Let <var>result</var> be the empty <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=
=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#string" id=3D"ref-for-string=E2=91=A4=E2=
=91=A6">string</a>.

 </p>
    </li><li>
     <p>While <var>position</var> doesn=E2=80=99t point past the end of <va=
r>input</var> and the
  <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#code-poi=
nt" id=3D"ref-for-code-point=E2=91=A3=E2=91=A5">code point</a> at <var>posi=
tion</var> within <var>input</var> meets the condition
  <var>condition</var>:

  </p>
     <ol>
      <li>
       <p>Append that <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.=
whatwg.org/#code-point" id=3D"ref-for-code-point=E2=91=A3=E2=91=A6">code po=
int</a> to the end of <var>result</var>.

   </p>
      </li><li>
       <p>Advance <var>position</var> by 1.
  </p>
     </li></ol>
    </li><li>
     <p>Return <var>result</var>.
</p>
   </li></ol>
   <p class=3D"note" role=3D"note">In addition to returning the collected <=
a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#code-point"=
 id=3D"ref-for-code-point=E2=91=A3=E2=91=A7">code points</a>, this algorith=
m updates the
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#string-pos=
ition-variable" id=3D"ref-for-string-position-variable">position variable</=
a> in the calling algorithm.

</p>
   <p>To <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-export=3D"" =
id=3D"skip-ascii-whitespace">skip ASCII whitespace</dfn> within a <a data-l=
ink-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#string" id=3D"ref-f=
or-string=E2=91=A4=E2=91=A7">string</a> <var>input</var> given a
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#string-pos=
ition-variable" id=3D"ref-for-string-position-variable=E2=91=A0">position v=
ariable</a> <var>position</var>, <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://=
infra.spec.whatwg.org/#collect-a-sequence-of-code-points" id=3D"ref-for-col=
lect-a-sequence-of-code-points">collect a sequence of code points</a> that =
are
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#ascii-whit=
espace" id=3D"ref-for-ascii-whitespace=E2=91=A3">ASCII whitespace</a> from =
<var>input</var> given <var>position</var>. The collected
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#code-point=
" id=3D"ref-for-code-point=E2=91=A3=E2=91=A8">code points</a> are not used,=
 but <var>position</var> is still updated.

</p>
