   <p>To <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-export=3D"" =
data-lt=3D"strictly split|strictly split a string" id=3D"strictly-split">st=
rictly split a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.=
org/#string" id=3D"ref-for-string=E2=91=A4=E2=91=A8">string</a></dfn>
<var>input</var> on a particular delimiter <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=
