s://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#string-position-variable" id=3D"ref-for-string-p=
osition-variable=E2=91=A1">position variable</a> for <var>input</var>, init=
ially
 pointing at the start of <var>input</var>.

 </p>
    </li><li>
     <p>Let <var>tokens</var> be a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https:=
//infra.spec.whatwg.org/#list" id=3D"ref-for-list=E2=91=A4">list</a> of <a =
data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#string" id=3D=
"ref-for-string=E2=91=A5=E2=93=AA">strings</a>, initially empty.

 </p>
    </li><li>
     <p>Let <var>token</var> be the result of <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" hre=
f=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#collect-a-sequence-of-code-points" id=
=3D"ref-for-collect-a-sequence-of-code-points=E2=91=A0">collecting a sequen=
ce of code points</a> that are
