on</var>.

 </p>
    </li><li>
     <p><a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#li=
st-append" id=3D"ref-for-list-append=E2=91=A7">Append</a> <var>token</var> =
to <var>tokens</var>.

 </p>
    </li><li>
     <p>While <var>position</var> is not past the end of <var>input</var>:

  </p>
     <ol>
      <li>
       <p><a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#=
