ref=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#collect-a-sequence-of-code-points" id=
=3D"ref-for-collect-a-sequence-of-code-points=E2=91=A2">collecting a sequen=
ce of code points</a> that are
   not <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#asc=
ii-whitespace" id=3D"ref-for-ascii-whitespace=E2=91=A5">ASCII whitespace</a=
> from <var>input</var>, given <var>position</var>.

   </p>
      </li><li>
       <p><a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#=
list-append" id=3D"ref-for-list-append=E2=91=A0=E2=93=AA">Append</a> <var>t=
oken</var> to <var>tokens</var>.

   </p>
      </li><li>
       <p><a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#=
skip-ascii-whitespace" id=3D"ref-for-skip-ascii-whitespace=E2=91=A0">Skip A=
SCII whitespace</a> within <var>input</var> given <var>position</var>.
  </p>
     </li></ol>
    </li><li>
     <p>Return <var>tokens</var>.
</p>
   </li></ol>
   <p>To <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-type=3D"dfn" data-export=3D"" =
data-lt=3D"split on commas|split a string on commas" id=3D"split-on-commas"=
>split a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#s=
tring" id=3D"ref-for-string=E2=91=A5=E2=91=A2">string</a>
<var>input</var> on commas</dfn>:

</p>
   <ol>
    <li>
     <p>Let <var>position</var> be a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"http=
s://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#string-position-variable" id=3D"ref-for-string-p=
osition-variable=E2=91=A3">position variable</a> for <var>input</var>, init=
ially
 pointing at the start of <var>input</var>.

 </p>
    </li><li>
     <p>Let <var>tokens</var> be a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https:=
//infra.spec.whatwg.org/#list" id=3D"ref-for-list=E2=91=A6">list</a> of <a =
data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#string" id=3D=
"ref-for-string=E2=91=A5=E2=91=A3">strings</a>, initially empty.

 </p>
    </li><li>
     <p>While <var>position</var> is not past the end of <var>input</var>:

  </p>
     <ol>
      <li>
