    </p>
       <p class=3D"note" role=3D"note"><var>token</var> might be the empty =
string.
   </p>
      </li><li><a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.=
org/#strip-leading-and-trailing-ascii-whitespace" id=3D"ref-for-strip-leadi=
ng-and-trailing-ascii-whitespace">Strip leading and trailing ASCII whitespa=
ce</a> from <var>token</var>.

