   <p>To <dfn class=3D"dfn-paneled" data-dfn-for=3D"string" data-dfn-type=
=3D"dfn" data-export=3D"" data-lt=3D"concatenate|concatenation" id=3D"strin=
g-concatenate">concatenate</dfn> a <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https:=
//infra.spec.whatwg.org/#list" id=3D"ref-for-list=E2=91=A7">list</a> of
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#string" id=
=3D"ref-for-string=E2=91=A5=E2=91=A4">strings</a> <var>list</var>, using an=
 optional separator string <var>separator</var>, run
these steps:

</p>
   <ol>
    <li>
     <p>If <var>list</var> <a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.=
spec.whatwg.org/#list-is-empty" id=3D"ref-for-list-is-empty">is empty</a>, =
then return the empty string.

 </p>
    </li><li>
