link" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#example-string-concatenate"></=
a>To serialize a set <var>set</var>, return the
<a data-link-type=3D"dfn" href=3D"https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#string-con=
catenate" id=3D"ref-for-string-concatenate">concatenation</a> of <var>set</=
